<title>USA: Fuqua Enterprises Q4 oper shr $0.38.</title>
<headline>Fuqua Enterprises Q4 oper shr $0.38.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.38		    $0.45</p>
<p> Oper net		1,748,000		1,918,000</p>
<p> Revs		   54,490,000	     31,463,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		4,549,000		4,259,000</p>
<p>Note - Oper share figures exclude year ago losses from discontinued operations of $3.34 million. Including those losses net was profit $1,748,000 or $0.38 per share vs year ago loss $1,424,000 or $0.33 per share.  </p>
<p>	   Year</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.60		    $1.32</p>
<p> Oper net		7,273,000		5,250,000</p>
<p> Revs		  181,543,000	    117,128,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		4,554,000		3,963,000</p>
<p>Note - Oper share figures exclude year ago losses from discontinued operations of $2.74 million. Including those losses net profit was $7,273,000 or $1.60 per share vs year ago profit $2,510,000 or $1.32 per share.</p>
